    "timeline_GLRXF": {
      "type": "timeline",
      "disabled": false,
      "settings": {
        "subheading": "Precision & Elegance, since 2010.",
        "title": "Our story",
        "text_position": "middle",
        "header-277c098d0cb4bb8533e767d035e328cd": null,
        "background": "#efefef",
        "text_color": "rgba(0,0,0,0)",
        "item_background": "#f5f5f5",
        "item_text_color": "rgba(0,0,0,0)"
      },
      "blocks": {
        "item_pWRa6": {
          "type": "item",
          "disabled": false,
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Garage.jpg",
            "label": "2010",
            "title": "2010",
            "content": "<h2>WILLIAM WOOD WAS ESTABLISHED</h2><p>Born in our grandmother’s garage, William Wood was founded on a simple yet powerful vision: to create timeless home furnishings with heart and purpose. What began as a small family endeavor has since grown into a brand fueled by passion and creativity. From minimalist mirrors to sleek modern décor and refined furniture, we design elegant pieces that elevate spaces with beauty and lasting impact.</p>",
            "button_text": "",
            "button_link": ""
          }
        },
        "item_ykRXQ": {
          "type": "item",
          "disabled": false,
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/WW_VideoEdit_HD_v1.3-_1-00-08-00__1_copy.jpg",
            "label": "2014",
            "title": "2014",
            "content": "<h2>OUR FIRST BIG MOVE</h2><p>2014 saw us pack up our things and leave the garage for our very own warehouse, a landmark step in our growth. With this move, we were no longer just a small operation, but a growing brand ready to scale. Our new space allowed us to expand our product range, embark upon more ambitious projects, and focus more highly on the quality of our collections. It was a leap forward not only in production but in our commitment to blending design and functionality.</p>",
            "button_text": "",
            "button_link": ""
          }
        },
        "item_jcaME": {
          "type": "item",
          "disabled": false,
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Community_copy_2.jpg",
            "label": "2016",
            "title": "2016",
            "content": "<h2>THE WILLIAM WOOD COMMUNITY IS BORN</h2><p>The launch of our social media presence marked one of the most pivotal turning points in our journey, propelling the growth of our business through community and allowing us to share our products on a larger scale for the first time. Since then, we’ve carefully curated every piece of content, collaborating with top influencers and brand ambassadors to consistently highlight our brand’s distinctive vision and style.</p>",
            "button_text": "",
            "button_link": ""
          }
        },
        "item_tV4Ej": {
          "type": "item",
          "disabled": false,
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/WW_22_WebsitePromo_v3_0_00_13_22_copy.jpg",
            "label": "2018",
            "title": "2018",
            "content": "<h2>A NEW APPROACH</h2><p>In 2018, we took a bold step forward with the launch of our website. </p><p></p><p>Built on best-in-class design and innovation, the William Wood online platform quickly became a destination for those in search of exceptional mirrors, lighting, and occasional furniture—offering a seamless shopping experience for those who appreciate timeless elegance and quality craftsmanship.</p>",
            "button_text": "",
            "button_link": ""
          }
        },
        "item_RmaMG": {
          "type": "item",
          "disabled": false,
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Warehouse_1_copy_copy.jpg",
            "label": "2021",
            "title": "2021",
            "content": "<h2>THE BIG MOVE</h2><p>In 2021, we expanded our operations by purchasing a 28,000-square-foot warehouse in Cheshire. This new facility has enabled us to significantly increase production, grow our team, and hold a larger stock inventory, ensuring we can keep up with rising demand and deliver more efficiently to our customers.</p>",
            "button_text": "",
            "button_link": ""
          }
        },
        "item_Mfjmp": {
          "type": "item",
          "disabled": false,
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/WW_24_FranceDeliveryImage.jpg",
            "label": "2024",
            "title": "2024",
            "content": "<h2>EUROPE IN SIGHT</h2><p>In 2024, we expanded our operations into France with the launch of our French store, inviting discerning design enthusiasts to discover our carefully curated collections. With the introduction of William Wood Dedicated Delivery Service, we have ensured our French customers receive the same exceptional efficiency, care, and attention to detail that William Wood is known for.</p>",
            "button_text": "",
            "button_link": ""
          }
        }
      },
