            "content": "<h2>@home_of_harris</h2><p>\"I’m fortunate enough to have a variety of William Wood's beautiful products in my home.. mirrors, coffee tables, lamps and vases. The items are varied but the quality most certainly isn’t - every piece is of such high quality, that’s what I love about the brand, the quality and the designs, they’re consistently ahead on the market. Add their impeccable service to the equation and you can see why I think they’re the best, I still get excited when I receive my text message from the dedicated driver about my delivery. Thank you William Wood!”</p>",
            "link_text": "",
            "link_url": "",
            "link_style": "link",
            "text_alignment": "center",
            "vertical_alignment": "start"
          }
        },
        "item_UN93U": {
          "type": "item",
          "disabled": false,
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Untitled-5.jpg",
            "image_width": 100,
            "image_border": "rgba(0,0,0,0)",
            "title": "",
            "content": "<h2>@interior.ela</h2><p>\"My experience with William Wood has been exceptional from the very start. The brand perfectly combines elegance and authenticity. Every detail is thoughtfully crafted, and the quality of the products is outstanding. Whether it’s the refined design or the materials used, everything is made with great care, and it truly shows. I’m proud to have William Wood creations in my home and to be part of this wonderful community. I highly recommend the brand to anyone looking for unique, high-quality pieces.\"</p>",
            "link_text": "",
            "link_url": "",
            "link_style": "link",
            "text_alignment": "center",
            "vertical_alignment": "start"
          }
        },
        "item_KHLfg": {
          "type": "item",
          "disabled": false,
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Luciana_Concrete_Arch_Full_Length_Extra_Large_mirror_cblovesinteriors_fc76b28d-dd39-466b-888b-94360775b911.jpg",
            "image_width": 100,
            "image_border": "rgba(0,0,0,0)",
            "title": "",
            "content": "<h2>@cb_loves_interiors_20</h2><p>\"William Wood has to be one of my favourite all time brands. The first mirror I purchased for our newly renovated home was from them over four years ago and I still have it now. I love how their style evolves and changes and I always look forward to their new product launches. All of the products I have from William Wood are not only stylish and innovative designs but they are top quality too.\"</p><p></p>",
            "link_text": "",
            "link_url": "",
            "link_style": "link",
            "text_alignment": "center",
            "vertical_alignment": "start"
          }
        },
        "item_gbVBx": {
          "type": "item",
          "disabled": false,
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Edge_Frameless_Arch_Large_lydiafleurfashion.jpg",
            "image_width": 100,
            "image_border": "rgba(0,0,0,0)",
            "title": "",
            "content": "<h2>@lydiafleurfashion</h2><p>\"You can feel in the quality that it is above so many other homeware brands and the delivery process has always been so efficient, I couldn’t recommend William Wood any more!”</p>",
            "link_text": "",
            "link_url": "",
            "link_style": "link",
            "text_alignment": "center",
            "vertical_alignment": "start"
          }
        }
      },
